## Original Content
President Trump is calling on world leaders to join his economic war against Iran. And, the Supreme Court is backing the president for now on his order to restrict mail-in voting.

## Summary
President Trump is calling on world leaders to join an economic isolation of Iran. Additionally, the Supreme Court has temporarily backed his order to restrict mail-in voting in the United States.

## Key Points
- Trump urges world leaders to isolate Iran economically as part of an 'economic war'
- The Supreme Court temporarily supports Trump's order to restrict mail-in voting
- The actions highlight ongoing political tensions involving Iran and domestic voting policies


